  "incident_classes_approved": true,
  "incident_classes_note": "APPROVED by the operator 2026-11-12 ~10:12 ET (D2-a map, D2-b unclassified = UNKNOWN, D2-c an override may only raise, never lower a P0, D2-d orphaned_stop = WARN / ACT TODAY and does not block). Record: coordinator/lead/D2-PROPOSAL-20261112.md. Approving the map does not by itself take the status verdict out of shadow (needs the home_snapshots migration and a validated release).",
