    "confirmed_no_overrides_unknown": true,
    "note": "R3, operator 2026-11-12 08:40 ET (v6 addendum section 3; DECISION.md I1): a NO from a good read overrides UNKNOWN; the unknown inputs stay listed. Read at run time by scripts/home_status_verdict.py (LQ-2411). Missing or not a boolean -> verdict UNKNOWN, cause 'config invalid', plus a data-quality row; never YES, never a silent NO. R1/R2 keys are not added until a consumer honours them (U2/U3)."
  },
